            <title>[IGNITE-10262] MVCC: Some client operation may hangs if all data nodes left the grid.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10262</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;IgniteClientCacheStartFailoverTest.testClientStartLastServerFailsMvccTx() hangs forever.&lt;/p&gt;

